Package: cleanislands
Type: Package
Title: Remove Small Islands From Metadata Labels on a Seurat Embedding
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sedat", "Kacar", email = "sedatkacar56@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Cleans a categorical metadata column of a Seurat object by removing
    small, isolated groups of cells (islands) and stray cells that sit apart from
    the main body of each label on a 2D embedding such as UMAP. Cells are grouped
    with DBSCAN and only groups above a minimum size are kept.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports: Seurat, dbscan
